    "body": "As Alex said above it might be okay to change this. My main worry is that we still have quite a [few `file:` URL issues](https://github.com/whatwg/url/labels/topic%3A%20file) outstanding and I'd rather tackle them comprehensively in one go. Especially if that came with some guarantee that we'd then all try to align on those changes and never revisit it again (modulo deployment fallout).",
